SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU: 66 (R) (or 38) miles Paradise Metric + or half!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Lynn Pfeil\n
 \nThis is a training ride for a few of us participating in America's Most 
 Beautiful Bike Ride for Blood Cancer United\, in Lake Tahoe on June 7th bu
 t **ALL ARE WELCOME**! We aren't speedy but you can ride your faster pace!
  This is a beautiful route\, with covered bridge\, other class Lancaster s
 ights\, and a few climbs. There will be plenty of rest stop options along 
 the way!\n\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/55009711\n\nNOT UP FOR 66? Here
 's a 38 mile route that splits off at mile 22 https://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/55014887\n\nInterested in **donating to Blood Cancer United** (formerly
  the Leukemia and Lymphoma Society)? http://tinyurl.com/tahoe26\n\nInteres
 ted in **joining us in Lake Tahoe**? [https://pages.lls.org/events/home/am
 bbr2026#register-section](https://pages.lls.org/events/home/ambbr2026#regi
 ster-section)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water an
 d a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo e
 liminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membe
 rship and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\nBeing on Meetup does not m
 ean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/c
 ontent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is your agreement to ab
 ide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/c
 ontent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the 
 Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.n
 et/docs.ashx?id=454318)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3146762
 81/
