SUMMARY:FreeOnFriday? Hershey Church 17R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Jan Zerfoss\
 , average pace 12 mph.\nCue and Ride with GPS link: [Hershey Church](https
 ://ridewithgps.com/routes/40245125)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Toget
 her**\n\nThis is a casual ride and the ride leader will ride at the advert
 ised pace. Some riders may ride faster than the leader so we'll likely bre
 ak into one or more smaller groups. We will stop to regroup periodically. 
 Please stay with other riders in your pace group so everyone has someone t
 o ride with and nobody is riding solo. Usually no designated sweep but nob
 ody will get dropped.\n\nIntercourse Park has well maintained restrooms th
 at are usually open.\n\nPost-ride coffee/refreshments - [Corner Coffee Sho
 p at Smucker Village](http://www.villageofintercourse.com/corner-coffee-sh
 op) . They have indoor and outdoor seating.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lever
 s\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper wai
 ver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ri
 de. Being on\nMeetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Membe
 r Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_i
 d=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Co
 nduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occur
 s: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=2
 2&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
