SUMMARY:Advanced Ride (B) LV Green Dragon (35H)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n***Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together***\n\nRide leader: Dan Maier\nAnticipated Average Pace: 1
 6-18 mph\nRoute: https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30713504\n\nYou visited Gr
 een Dragon for food and deals on Friday. Now enjoy the local hills on Satu
 rday morning!\n\nWe will re-group at the intersection of Mohler Church Rd.
  and Ridge Ave. after the climb up from Green Dragon. We can stop at Glenw
 ood Foods Cafe (close to mile 20).\n\nThis is a B level ride. The ride lea
 der will ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a gr
 oup ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his
 /her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and a swe
 eper may also be appointed at the start.\nPlease do not join this ride if 
 you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\
 , you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If
  maintaining a 16-18 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, pl
 ease consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ea
 rbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers
 \, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiv
 er\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this rid
 e. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.\nJoin here [Member
  Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id
 =257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Condu
 ct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_
 id=60&club_id=257148)\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](
 https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modul
 e_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3145117
 80/
